00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.700
He couldn't speak English.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:36.290
He just had to provide for his family.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:39.150
We lived extremely humbly my whole life.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:40.860
My dad worked very hard.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.330
We saved every dollar.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.100
I went on one family
vacation my entire childhood.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.740
