is because you're worried
about what other people think,

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.720
or if you don't get enough likes,

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.950
or all that other crap that
everybody worries about.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.400
It's called insecurity.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.994
You actually worry about
what the other person

00:12:09.994 --> 00:12:11.890
sitting next to you thinks.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:14.885
I understand it, I
respect it, 99% of people

00:12:14.885 --> 00:12:17.608
live life that way, but the reality is,

00:12:17.608 --> 00:12:20.544
the quicker you figure out
how not to factor that in

00:12:20.544 --> 00:12:23.643
is the quicker you're gonna
get real happy, real fast.

00:12:23.643 --> 00:12:26.226
